WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:14.758
"How did you get into my room?" the young girl in blue asked.

2
00:00:14.759 --> 00:00:16.488
"We're lost.

3
00:00:16.489 --> 00:00:22.539
We're looking for a statue of a woman," Mandy said quickly.

4
00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:27.083
"Lydia, bring Jason," the girl in blue said.

5
00:00:27.084 --> 00:00:29.042
"He'll know what to do."

6
00:00:29.043 --> 00:00:31.877
The other girl bowed and left.

7
00:00:31.878 --> 00:00:36.678
"Is Lydia your friend?" wondered Mandy.

8
00:00:36.679 --> 00:00:40.219
"No, she is our slave.

9
00:00:40.220 --> 00:00:44.276
Most Greeks have slaves," said the girl.

10
00:00:44.277 --> 00:00:46.001
"Who are you?"

11
00:00:46.002 --> 00:00:49.742
The children introduced themselves.

12
00:00:49.743 --> 00:00:53.221
"My name is Callia," said the girl.

13
00:00:53.222 --> 00:00:55.675
But she did not smile.

14
00:00:55.676 --> 00:00:58.381
"This cloth is very pretty,"

15
00:00:58.382 --> 00:01:01.811
Mandy said, trying to change the mood.

16
00:01:01.812 --> 00:01:03.481
"Do you weave?"

17
00:01:03.482 --> 00:01:09.592
"Yes, I do. I am making cloth for my wedding," said Callia.

18
00:01:09.593 --> 00:01:12.305
Her anger was almost gone.

19
00:01:12.306 --> 00:01:16.868
"After the Olympic Games, I will be married."

20
00:01:16.869 --> 00:01:22.079
"Married?" Mandy cried. "You're so young!"

21
00:01:22.080 --> 00:01:24.866
Now Callia smiled.

22
00:01:24.867 --> 00:01:27.474
"You're not from Athens, are you?

23
00:01:27.475 --> 00:01:32.223
Girls here marry when they are 14 years old."

24
00:01:32.224 --> 00:01:35.759
"Callia!" a boy's voice called.

25
00:01:35.760 --> 00:01:40.536
"Jason!" Callia cried, running to greet him.

26
00:01:40.537 --> 00:01:44.753
Jason was careful not to step into the room.

27
00:01:44.754 --> 00:01:49.423
Callia introduced the children to her brother.

28
00:01:49.424 --> 00:01:54.677
"You are lucky my sister has a good heart," said Jason.

29
00:01:54.678 --> 00:01:57.541
"Father will not hear about this.

30
00:01:57.542 --> 00:02:00.935
This room is only for women and girls.

31
00:02:00.936 --> 00:02:04.608
Men and boys are not allowed here."

32
00:02:04.609 --> 00:02:08.679
Vinnie quickly moved to stand beside Jason.

33
00:02:08.680 --> 00:02:14.945
"They say they need to find a statue of a woman," said Callia.

34
00:02:14.946 --> 00:02:17.869
Jason burst out laughing.

35
00:02:17.870 --> 00:02:22.207
"Athens has many statues of women!" he said.

36
00:02:22.208 --> 00:02:24.407
"Can you tell us more?"

37
00:02:24.408 --> 00:02:33.573
"She has a big helmet," said Mandy, "and holds a smaller woman with wings in her right hand."

38
00:02:33.574 --> 00:02:37.806
"Wait, you speak of Athena," said Jason.

39
00:02:37.807 --> 00:02:40.543
"She is the goddess of our city.

40
00:02:40.544 --> 00:02:44.601
That statue is in her temple, the Parthenon.

41
00:02:44.602 --> 00:02:48.342
It is at the top of the Acropolis."

42
00:02:48.343 --> 00:02:51.939
"The Parthenon!" cried Mandy.

43
00:02:51.940 --> 00:02:55.283
"I'll take you there," said Jason.

44
00:02:55.284 --> 00:02:59.015
"But I am going to the gymnasium first."

45
00:02:59.016 --> 00:03:04.271
"Thank you," said Vinnie and Mandy.

46
00:03:04.272 --> 00:03:08.149
The children followed Jason through the house.

47
00:03:08.150 --> 00:03:11.427
The home was built around a courtyard.

48
00:03:11.428 --> 00:03:15.829
Mandy noticed a kitchen and a workshop.

49
00:03:15.830 --> 00:03:19.415
People were coming and going.

50
00:03:19.416 --> 00:03:22.208
One room had couches.

51
00:03:22.209 --> 00:03:26.859
Some people carried small barrels into this room.

52
00:03:26.860 --> 00:03:31.072
One person carried what looked like a flute.

53
00:03:31.073 --> 00:03:35.140
"We hold symposia there," Jason said.

54
00:03:35.141 --> 00:03:37.219
"No girls allowed."

55
00:03:37.220 --> 00:03:40.019
He smiled at Vinnie.

56
00:03:40.020 --> 00:03:42.746
"Symposia are dinner parties.

57
00:03:42.747 --> 00:03:44.443
We eat and drink.

58
00:03:44.444 --> 00:03:47.322
We discuss many important things."

59
00:03:47.323 --> 00:03:49.610
Jason winked at Vinnie.

60
00:03:49.611 --> 00:03:55.663
"Of course, we have a lot of fun too!"
